;font-weight:700;color:#059669;\">Bulk Reassign</span><span style=\"padding:3px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(217,119,6,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#d97706;\">Case Detail Shell</span><span style=\"padding:3px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(220,38,38,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">Case Action Request</span><span style=\"padding:3px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(37,99,235,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb;\">Alert Breakdown</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
